# Rattlesnake run output: measurement data, often 10 MB to 30 GB per file.
# Never commit it -- a "git add -A" swept 23 MB of it onto a public branch on 2026-11-04.
# Upstream example data under src/rattlesnake/examples/ stays addable.
*.nc4
!src/rattlesnake/examples/**/*.nc4

# Collected law set (control_laws/tests/make_law_set.py).  Two of these laws
